DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
6132::$$$message_0043_0000_0000$$$::...That's unusual.[lr]::
6133::$$$message_0043_0000_0001$$$::Caster's just standing there, seemingly lost in thought.::
6134::$$$message_0043_0001_0000$$$::Good timing.[lr]::
6135::$$$message_0043_0001_0001$$$::There's no one else around, so I'll ask her about the restarted Holy Grail War.[lr]::
6136::$$$message_0043_0001_0002$$$::Caster's settled down for now, but she did cast a Bounded Field on the entire town before.[lr]::
6137::$$$message_0043_0001_0003$$$::I should make sure she isn't up to no good again, even if it's unlikely.::
6138::$$$message_0043_0002_0000$$$::"Caster. Do you mind if we talk a bit?"[lr]::
6139::$$$message_0043_0002_0001$$$::She removes her gloomy hood and shoots me an icy look.::
6140::$$$message_0043_0003_0000$$$::"About what? I doubt it's anything good, coming from you."[lr]::
6141::$$$message_0043_0003_0001$$$::...I feel like she's on her guard. [l]She was so sociable when I ran into her in town, but now it's like she's back to half a year ago.::
6142::$$$message_0043_0004_0000$$$::"Well, that depends on you.[lr]::
6143::$$$message_0043_0004_0001$$$::I'll get straight to the point. You aren't up to anything lately, are you? [l][say storage=ryu0117_shi_0012 name=士郎]I hope cloistered temple life hasn't been so stressful for you that you've fallen back on old habits."[lr]::
6144::$$$message_0043_0004_0002$$$::We seem to have gotten off on the wrong foot, so I try to phrase it delicately without offending Caster.::
6145::$$$message_0043_0005_0000$$$::"Ohoho. What an interesting question, boy.[lr]::
6146::$$$message_0043_0005_0001$$$::Did you come all this way to ask me that so I could murder and bury you without anyone ever finding out?"::
6147::$$$message_0043_0006_0000$$$::"My mistake. Have you noticed anything strange going on in town recently?"[lr]::
6148::$$$message_0043_0006_0001$$$::Sorry, ma'am. You scared me straight. The most cunning strategist of the Servants flashes me a devilish smile, showing me she hasn't lost her edge after six months of domestic life after all. Lesson learned.::
6149::$$$message_0043_0007_0000$$$::"Start with that next time.[lr]::
6150::$$$message_0043_0007_0001$$$::And no, I am not feeling any particular stress."[lr]::
6151::$$$message_0043_0007_0002$$$::...It's like hearing a drunk person insist that they're not drunk.[lr]::
6152::$$$message_0043_0007_0003$$$::...I sure hope things are okay at Ryudou Temple.::
6153::$$$message_0043_0008_0000$$$::"Oh. Well, some exercise might be good for you. You could run a marathon, fix the temple stairs, even put on a light show in the Einzbern Forest."[lr]::
6154::$$$message_0043_0008_0001$$$::The mountain woods would be a more than sufficient proving ground for Caster to blow off some steam. Plus, Berserker might even be willing to play along for a mock battle.::
6155::$$$message_0043_0009_0000$$$::"Why, thank you for thinking of me. But I don't need to go all the way to the forest, you know. I could start with a warm-up right here.[lr]::
6156::$$$message_0043_0009_0001$$$::...Though, I wouldn't be the one doing the running."[lr]::
6157::$$$message_0043_0009_0002$$$::"Urgh."[lr]::
6158::$$$message_0043_0009_0003$$$::Uh-oh. We really are getting off on the wrong foot.[lr]::
6159::$$$message_0043_0009_0004$$$::At this rate, the war really will just repeat itself. I should stick to business.::
6160::$$$message_0043_0010_0000$$$::"Maybe another time.[lr]::
6161::$$$message_0043_0010_0001$$$::So, about what's going on..."[lr]::
6162::$$$message_0043_0010_0002$$$::"I haven't the slightest clue. [l][say storage=ryu0117_cas_0041 name=キャスター]I have noticed that something feels strange about the city, but its cause is unknown to me, nor am I interested."::
6163::$$$message_0043_0011_0000$$$::"...I see.[lr]::
6164::$$$message_0043_0011_0001$$$::I guess you wouldn't know right away, though."[lr]::
6165::$$$message_0043_0011_0002$$$::If I asked Caster, it might not take her much effort to figure out exactly what's happening.[lr]::
6166::$$$message_0043_0011_0003$$$::The Holy Grail War has restarted.[lr]::
6167::$$$message_0043_0011_0004$$$::All of the Servants are present.[lr]::
6168::$$$message_0043_0011_0005$$$::And I have this odd sense of...déjà vu.::
6169::$$$message_0043_0012_0000$$$::"Setting that aside...[lr]::
6170::$$$message_0043_0012_0001$$$::Can I take that to mean you have nothing to do with it?"[lr]::
6171::$$$message_0043_0012_0002$$$::"Yes. You can choose to believe me, or not."::
6172::$$$message_0043_0013_0000$$$::"I believe you. You like to scheme, but you don't lie."[lr]::
6173::$$$message_0043_0013_0001$$$::Actually, Caster never lies.[lr]::
6174::$$$message_0043_0013_0002$$$::I wonder if it's her idea of virtue or fairness.::
6175::$$$message_0043_0014_0000$$$::"So this situation doesn't matter to you.[lr]::
6176::$$$message_0043_0014_0001$$$::You won't try and fight any of the other Servants, then?"::
6177::$$$message_0043_0015_0000$$$::"Of course not. No mage would expend magical energy with nothing to gain for it.[lr]::
6178::$$$message_0043_0015_0001$$$::That goes for you as[line len=2][lr]::
6179::$$$message_0043_0015_0002$$$::No, I suppose that wouldn't be important to you."::
6180::$$$message_0043_0016_0000$$$::Caster chuckles.[lr]::
6181::$$$message_0043_0016_0001$$$::I can tell she's making fun of me, but not in a mean-spirited way.[lr]::
6182::$$$message_0043_0016_0002$$$::She sounds bright and cheerful.[lr]::
6183::$$$message_0043_0016_0003$$$::Anyway, it's clear she has no intention of helping me figure this out. She might even prefer things to stay as they are.::
6184::$$$message_0043_0017_0000$$$::"All right, I get it. So you won't pull any funny business?"[lr]::
6185::$$$message_0043_0017_0001$$$::"No. Sorry to disappoint you, but I won't lift a finger.[lr]::
6186::$$$message_0043_0017_0002$$$::If you want to find whoever restarted the Holy Grail War, you'll have to do it on your own."[lr]::
6187::$$$message_0043_0017_0003$$$::Sounds about right.::
6188::$$$message_0043_0018_0000$$$::"Oh? You're taking this quite well. I thought you would try harder to convince me."[lr]::
6189::$$$message_0043_0018_0001$$$::"Even I know better than to ask the impossible.[lr]::
6190::$$$message_0043_0018_0002$$$::You don't want to help, right? Then I'll do it myself... I might come by again if I run out of options, but I can cross that bridge when I come to it."[lr]::
6191::$$$message_0043_0018_0003$$$::Then I'll just have to do whatever it takes to persuade her, as she just alluded to.::
6192::$$$message_0043_0019_0000$$$::Huh.[lr]::
6193::$$$message_0043_0019_0001$$$::Was she looking forward to turning me down?[lr]::
6194::$$$message_0043_0019_0002$$$::Caster looks disappointed.::
6195::$$$message_0043_0020_0000$$$::"...Are you feeling all right? Did someone hit you with a curse of debilitation when you weren't paying attention?[lr]::
6196::$$$message_0043_0020_0001$$$::This isn't like you. Where did your usual stubbornness go?"::
6197::$$$message_0043_0021_0000$$$::...Mrgh. Gotta hand it to a world-renowned witch. When it comes to being a worrywart, she's on a different level than Tohsaka.[lr]::
6198::$$$message_0043_0021_0001$$$::Actually, if she wanted to make me give up, I wish she'd use some of her broad magical repertoire to neutralize or hypnotize me. It feels like a waste to weaken me with verbal discouragement.[lr]::
6199::$$$message_0043_0021_0002$$$::Anyway...::
6200::$$$message_0043_0022_0000$$$::"Nobody cursed me. You're the only one who would.[lr]::
6201::$$$message_0043_0022_0001$$$::Besides...I bet I'm a pest, from your point of view."[lr]::
6202::$$$message_0043_0022_0002$$$::I say what I think, without any ill intent behind it.[lr]::
6203::$$$message_0043_0022_0003$$$::Once again, Caster looks taken aback.[lr]::
6204::$$$message_0043_0022_0004$$$::She sighs, looking like my remark threw her off-balance.::
6205::$$$message_0043_0023_0000$$$::"...Good grief. [font italic=true]That's[font italic=false] what you say next?[lr]::
6206::$$$message_0043_0023_0001$$$::Yes, to be blunt, you are an eyesore. You won the war, while we lost. No matter how peaceful life may seem now, it's hard to forget the shame of failure.[lr]::
6207::$$$message_0043_0023_0002$$$::...I also can't relax when you're around.[lr]::
6208::$$$message_0043_0023_0003$$$::When I'm in a bad mood, I don't want to think about your naïve righteousness, nor how you won the war with it."::
6209::$$$message_0043_0024_0000$$$::Caster's hostility is genuine. I really do annoy her.[lr]::
6210::$$$message_0043_0024_0001$$$::Still, though...[lr]::
6211::$$$message_0043_0024_0002$$$::She doesn't dislike me for her own sake. I can see that she's wary of me for another reason.[lr]::
6212::$$$message_0043_0024_0003$$$::I've gotten a good look at what that is already, so I just nod. [wait canskip=0 time=800]No need to get hung up on it.::
6213::$$$message_0043_0025_0000$$$::"...Hmph. Do be careful, boy.[lr]::
6214::$$$message_0043_0025_0001$$$::When I see you all alone like this, I'm liable to want to squish you like a bug. Though I can't if Saber is with you."[lr]::
6215::$$$message_0043_0025_0002$$$::"Liar. You wouldn't pull your punches just because of Saber. You're staying out of a fight because you have more important things to worry about."[lr]::
6216::$$$message_0043_0025_0003$$$::Like her peaceful life at Ryudou Temple, for example.::
6217::$$$message_0043_0026_0000$$$::"...Think whatever you wish.[lr]::
6218::$$$message_0043_0026_0001$$$::Believe me, if you were even slightly unscrupulous, I would have already paid you back for what you did to me.[lr]::
6219::$$$message_0043_0026_0002$$$::If you ever feel like dying of self-loathing, then give in to your greed. I'd be more than happy to grant you a bewitching death."::
6220::$$$message_0043_0027_0000$$$::The extraordinary witch smirks.[lr]::
6221::$$$message_0043_0027_0001$$$::We really can't get along after all. She's all but declared war on me, even after claiming she doesn't want to fight.::
6222::$$$message_0043_0028_0000$$$::"...All in good time.[lr]::
6223::$$$message_0043_0028_0001$$$::Would you tell me something, though?[lr]::
6224::$$$message_0043_0028_0002$$$::The way things are now isn't exactly harmful, is it? Will it get worse?"::
6225::$$$message_0043_0029_0000$$$::"That's right. It isn't harmful and it won't worsen. I guarantee it.[lr]::
6226::$$$message_0043_0029_0001$$$::...Yes, this is like a fleeting dream. In the end, nothing of consequence will happen, and all will return to as it was."::
6227::$$$message_0043_0030_0000$$$::...Good.[lr]::
6228::$$$message_0043_0030_0001$$$::I'll continue my investigation the old-fashioned way.[lr]::
6229::$$$message_0043_0030_0002$$$::It's enough to know that Caster isn't involved and has no plans to do so.::
6230::$$$message_0043_0031_0000$$$::"Bye, then. I'll come calling the next time you're in a better mood."[lr]::
6231::$$$message_0043_0031_0001$$$::"You do that. I'd like to avoid making enemies of Saber and Rider, as well.[lr]::
6232::$$$message_0043_0031_0002$$$::...Allow me to give you a warning, before you go.[lr]::
6233::$$$message_0043_0031_0003$$$::Don't go near the church at night. You can't handle who you'll find there."[lr]::
6234::$$$message_0043_0031_0004$$$::...She puts on her hood and leaves.[lr]::
6235::$$$message_0043_0031_0005$$$::Oh. Did she take it off during our conversation just to be nice...?::
906133::$$$message_9043_0000_0001$$$::Caster's just standing there, seemingly lost in thought.[r]M~��